{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"s5hs000000000000","type":"text","text":"# S5 · 流控初始化：两阶段握手的时序\n组库那张是**状态机视角**。这张是 **Figure 3-3 的时序视角**：Endpoint 先动、Switch 稍后跟上，盯着 $FI1$ / $FI2$ 在哪一刻置位。右侧是两种**失步场景**——它们解释了 spec 里那几条看起来多余的兜底规则。","x":-1350,"y":-1320,"width":1550,"height":110},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000011","type":"text","text":"## 线上","x":-840,"y":-1140,"width":520,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000021","type":"text","text":"**t1** EP → SW\nInitFC1-P（Hdr 01h · Data 040h）\nInitFC1-NP（01h · 040h）\nInitFC1-Cpl（01h · 040h）\n≥ 每 34 µs 重复一轮","x":-840,"y":-920,"width":520,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000041","type":"text","text":"**t3** EP → SW\nInitFC2-P / NP / Cpl\n（值和 InitFC1 一样，但 SW 在 FC_INIT2 里会**忽略值**）","x":-840,"y":-440,"width":520,"height":110,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000031","type":"text","text":"**t2** SW → EP\nInitFC1-P / NP / Cpl（01h · 040h）","x":-840,"y":-600,"width":520,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000050","type":"text","text":"**t4** SW → EP\nInitFC2-P / NP / Cpl","x":-840,"y":-260,"width":520,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000051","type":"text","text":"**t4** EP 收到**任意一条** InitFC2\n**$FI2 := 1$** → Signal completion\nVC0 就绪 → DLCMSM → **DL_Active**","x":-1350,"y":-270,"width":420,"height":110,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000032","type":"text","text":"**t2** EP 收到 SW 的三条 → 记录 P/NP/Cpl 三类 credit\n**三类齐 → $FI1 := 1$** → 进 $FC\\_INIT2$\n⭐ **输出 $DL\\_Up$**（比 DL_Active 早）","x":-1350,"y":-720,"width":420,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000020","type":"text","text":"**t0** 进 DL_Init → $FC\\_INIT1$\n输出 $DL\\_Down$\n阻塞 VC0 的 TLP","x":-1350,"y":-1020,"width":420,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000010","type":"text","text":"## Endpoint（先动）","x":-1350,"y":-1140,"width":420,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000052","type":"text","text":"**t4'** SW 收到 EP 的任意 InitFC2\n**$FI2 := 1$** → 完成 → **DL_Active**","x":-240,"y":-60,"width":420,"height":110,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000040","type":"text","text":"**t3** SW 收到 EP 重发的 InitFC1（或下面的 InitFC2）→ 记录三类\n**$FI1 := 1$** → 进 $FC\\_INIT2$，输出 $DL\\_Up$","x":-240,"y":-440,"width":420,"height":110,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000022","type":"text","text":"**t1** SW 还没进 FC_INIT1\n（或刚进）—— 收到就记录，没进就丢弃，反正 EP 会重发","x":-240,"y":-1020,"width":420,"height":100},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000030","type":"text","text":"**t2** SW 进 DL_Init → $FC\\_INIT1$\n输出 $DL\\_Down$","x":-240,"y":-720,"width":420,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000012","type":"text","text":"## Switch（稍后）","x":-240,"y":-1140,"width":420,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000001","type":"text","text":"**本板配色**\n- 紫：状态 / 子状态\n- 绿：线上的 DLLP\n- 黄：标志置位 / 状态输出\n- 红：结论\n- 无色：说明","x":240,"y":-1500,"width":460,"height":180},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000080","type":"text","text":"## 失步 ②：InitFC2 全丢了","x":400,"y":-340,"width":760,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000081","type":"text","text":"EP 收到 SW 的 InitFC2 → 完成 → DL_Active → 开始发 **TLP** 和 **UpdateFC**。\nSW 发给 EP 的没问题，但 **EP 发给 SW 的 InitFC2 全丢** → SW 永远等不到 InitFC2？\n\n**不会。** $FI2$ 有三条置位路径：\n① 收到该 VC 的任意 **InitFC2**（正常）\n② 收到该 VC 上的任意 **TLP**（兜底）\n③ 收到该 VC 的任意 **UpdateFC**（兜底）\n\nSW 收到 EP 的 TLP / UpdateFC → 「EP 早跑起来了」→ $FI2$ → 完成。**死锁解除。**","x":400,"y":-260,"width":760,"height":240},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000070","type":"text","text":"## 失步 ①：一方快、一方慢","x":400,"y":-830,"width":760,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000071","type":"text","text":"EP 已进 FC_INIT2、在发 InitFC2；SW 刚进 FC_INIT1，**第一次收到的就是 EP 的 InitFC2**。\n\nspec 规则：FC_INIT1 处理「received **InitFC1 and InitFC2** DLLPs」—— **InitFC2 里的 credit 值也记**。\nSW 直接从 InitFC2 里凑齐三类 → $FI1$ → 进 FC_INIT2。\n\n**不错过任何信息**：对方能发 InitFC2，说明它早收全了我的，而且 InitFC2 同样携带它的 credit。","x":400,"y":-740,"width":760,"height":260},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000082","type":"text","text":"⭐ **为什么兜底是安全的**\nSW 还在 FC_INIT2 → 它的 $FI1$ 早置位了 → 它**已经有** EP 的 credit，能正确处理收到的 TLP。\nEP 都发 TLP 了 → EP 一定完成了 → EP 一定拿到了 SW 的 credit。**逻辑闭环。**\n\n又是「**用对方的行为推断状态，不死等约定信号**」（S4 的 InitFC1 退出路径、S10 的重复包回 Ack 同一套路）。","x":400,"y":80,"width":760,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000060","type":"text","text":"⭐ **两阶段的本质**\n**FC_INIT1 是数据阶段**：发我的 credit、记你的 credit（InitFC1 **和** InitFC2 都记）\n**FC_INIT2 是确认阶段**：告诉你「你的我收到了」、等你也这么说（收到的值**忽略**，只当信号）\n只有一阶段不行：我知道你的，但不知道你知不知道我的 → 你可能在没 credit 时发 TLP → 溢出。**和 TCP 三次握手是同一类问题。**","x":-1470,"y":50,"width":1080,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000090","type":"text","text":"### 040h 是怎么来的（要会算）\n1 个 data credit = **4 DW = 16 B**\nMPS = 1024 B → 1024 ÷ 16 = **64 = 0x40** ✅\n\n最小通告 = 能装下一个最大 TLP，否则那个 TLP 永远发不出去（死锁）。\nHdr credit 通告 01h：一个 TLP 一个 header（推断，正式规则在 §2.6.1）。","x":-1350,"y":300,"width":700,"height":220},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000091","type":"text","text":"### 两个阶段共同的约束（spec 各写了两遍）\n- 事务层**必须**阻塞 **VCx** 的 TLP（只挡这个 VC）\n- 三条按**相对顺序** P → NP → Cpl（中间可插别的东西）\n- ≥ 每 34 µs 一轮；Recovery / Configuration 时间不计入；**强烈建议**空闲时多发\n- 除保证 34 µs 频率外**不得阻塞其他传输**：物理层 OS · Ack/Nak · 已初始化 VC 的 TLP\n- Scale 字段：激活填 01b/10b/11b，否则 00b（S6）","x":-580,"y":300,"width":740,"height":220},
		{"id":"s5hs000000000092","type":"text","text":"### 图上的 SDP / END\n`SDP │ P │ 0 │ 01 │ 040 │ CRC │ END`\nSDP / END 是物理层 8b/10b 的成帧 K 码，**不属于第 3 章**。中间 6 字节才是 DLLP 本体。\n128b/130b 时代用 Token 成帧，但 DLLP 本体完全一样。","x":240,"y":300,"width":780,"height":220}
	],
